  "description": "Tonquin Giza is a bold and distinctive fragrance that blends rich amber warmth with animalic depth and smooth woody notes. The scent feels intense, luxurious, and slightly exotic, delivering a powerful presence with a refined edge. The opening introduces warm amber and subtle spice, creating a deep and captivating first impression. The heart develops into animalic nuances and soft floral tones, adding complexity and a sensual character. The base settles into woods, musk, and rich resins, leaving a long-lasting trail that feels warm, bold, and unforgettable. Tonquin Giza is ideal for those who enjoy strong, unique fragrances with amber richness and animalic depth.",
